	<header class=3D"entry-header">
		<h1 class=3D"entry-title">How to Chinese remainder, part&nbsp;1</h1>

				<div class=3D"entry-meta">
						<span class=3D"sep">Posted on </span><a href=3D"https://exploringnumb=
ertheory.wordpress.com/2015/11/15/how-to-chinese-remainder-part-1/" title=
=3D"12:46 am" rel=3D"bookmark"><time class=3D"entry-date" datetime=3D"2015-=
