01002" alt=3D"x \equiv 1 \ (\text{mod} \ 3)" class=3D"latex"></p>
</ul>
<p>The problem is then to solve the system of the above 3 linear congruence=
 equations. The solution is <img src=3D"https://s0.wp.com/latex.php?latex=
=3Dx_0%3D2+%5Ccdot+42+%5Ccdot+8%2B5+%5Ccdot+15+%5Ccdot+1%2B1+%5Ccdot+70+%5C=
cdot+1&amp;bg=3Dffffff&amp;fg=3D333333&amp;s=3D0&amp;c=3D20201002" alt=3D"x=
_0=3D2 \cdot 42 \cdot 8+5 \cdot 15 \cdot 1+1 \cdot 70 \cdot 1" class=3D"lat=
ex"> where:</p>
<ul>
<img src=3D"https://s0.wp.com/latex.php?latex=3D42%3D14+%5Ccdot+3&amp;bg=3D=
ffffff&amp;fg=3D333333&amp;s=3D0&amp;c=3D20201002" alt=3D"42=3D14 \cdot 3" =
class=3D"latex"> and <img src=3D"https://s0.wp.com/latex.php?latex=3D42+%5C=
cdot+8+%5Cequiv+1+%5C+%28%5Ctext%7Bmod%7D+%5C+5%29&amp;bg=3Dffffff&amp;fg=
=3D333333&amp;s=3D0&amp;c=3D20201002" alt=3D"42 \cdot 8 \equiv 1 \ (\text{m=
od} \ 5)" class=3D"latex"><p></p>
<p><img src=3D"https://s0.wp.com/latex.php?latex=3D15%3D5+%5Ccdot+3&amp;bg=
=3Dffffff&amp;fg=3D333333&amp;s=3D0&amp;c=3D20201002" alt=3D"15=3D5 \cdot 3=
" class=3D"latex"> and <img src=3D"https://s0.wp.com/latex.php?latex=3D15+%=
5Ccdot+1+%5Cequiv+1+%5C+%28%5Ctext%7Bmod%7D+%5C+14%29&amp;bg=3Dffffff&amp;f=
g=3D333333&amp;s=3D0&amp;c=3D20201002" alt=3D"15 \cdot 1 \equiv 1 \ (\text{=
