<p><img src=3D"https://s0.wp.com/latex.php?latex=3D70%3D5+%5Ccdot+14&amp;bg=
=3Dffffff&amp;fg=3D333333&amp;s=3D0&amp;c=3D20201002" alt=3D"70=3D5 \cdot 1=
4" class=3D"latex"> and <img src=3D"https://s0.wp.com/latex.php?latex=3D70+=
%5Ccdot+1+%5Cequiv+1+%5C+%28%5Ctext%7Bmod%7D+%5C+3%29&amp;bg=3Dffffff&amp;f=
