<ul>
<img src=3D"https://s0.wp.com/latex.php?latex=3D%5Cdisplaystyle+%5Cbegin%7B=
aligned%7D+x_0%26%5Cequiv+2+%5Ccdot+42+%5Ccdot+8%2B5+%5Ccdot+15+%5Ccdot+1%2=
B1+%5Ccdot+70+%5Ccdot+1+%5C+%28%5Ctext%7Bmod%7D+%5C+210%29+%5C%5C%26%5Cequi=
